{
  "result": "If I could change just one thing, it would be to give everyone the ability to truly *feel* what other people are feeling \u2014 real, automatic empathy.\n\nNot just understanding someone intellectually, but actually feeling for a moment what it's like to be them. To feel their worries, their hopes, their history.\n\nI think so many of our biggest problems \u2014 cruelty, loneliness, war, inequality, even how we treat the planet \u2014 come from a failure to imagine each other's inner lives. If we could feel that connection, even briefly, I think kindness would stop being a choice you have to try to make and just become the obvious thing to do.\n\nAnd then people wouldn't *need* to be told to be better to each other \u2014 they just would be.\n\nWhat about you? What would your one change be?",
